{"generated": "2026-08-07 12:20", "brief": "<b>1. 중국 유니트리, 글로벌 투자자 유치하며 대규모 IPO 추진</b>\n중국 휴머노이드 로봇 제조사 유니트리가 인공지능 스타트업 딥시크와 중국 국영 석유기업 등의 투자를 받으며 약 9억 달러(약 1조 2천억 원) 규모의 IPO 공모가를 확정했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiT0FVX3lxTFBpajdFZlMzdVJBWks3bmc5dVlhZ2d6N1hvUks1U3JQS1FJekdKRTB1cGhvVXRfQUlJSURaa0czaklvWjZ3V2Q5V01ZdWlqdzg?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#19</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE9DRWltd0ZaeEpvVVJYZVhYM3RJT01STXhLNElvVWt6QU1zSFhNS2RYMng5N2RocXhzSFlOUnZqeXkxSlNTMEI3dWRhVENnbW1uQzU0YjA5ZDNsQQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#20</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxOdXBWVF8zeGZ6emVGSDlZNUhPYXNlTDVsUlhFMFFfbUdSelhPZnZzVk43WGRSaXRaOEk1NFVGT1NCSmNweV9KYmhaNWZpRmlIYVFidGdqemdDSkJJNVpNcGxBMlRMREs0ZkE3Nmk5dl93U3g5aVVDRVpuTFJkU3NybTM4RVJ5c2hqNXJaaW80VWR5d3h5Y25HTE1yS1JKUFJ2bVpfd1lxMFNoMmgxWXc5TmNhYzQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#36</a>]. 이번 공모를 통해 유니트리의 기업가치는 약 12조 8천억 원(96억 달러)에 달할 것으로 평가받고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiWkFVX3lxTE9DRWltd0ZaeEpvVVJYZVhYM3RJT01STXhLNElvVWt6QU1zSFhNS2RYMng5N2RocXhzSFlOUnZqeXkxSlNTMEI3dWRhVENnbW1uQzU0YjA5ZDNsQQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#20</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVEFVX3lxTE16cFJ2VXpoTTdkQzdOMUlxM1lyVVRmOTBMZ3pKTkdULXZ2c3kxWXdKOHdjbjB4UDFDcGg2T0EwVlk0OUswYjg5M2tUQlRGS1gwUjkwcA?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#29</a>].\n\n<b>2. 한미그룹, 경영권 분쟁 재점화에 따른 여론전 격화</b>\n한미그룹의 경영권을 둘러싼 대주주 일가 간의 갈등이 다시 수면 위로 떠오르며 양측의 공방이 치열해지고 있습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTFBtVDhFLXNNTmFLbVBQMVh4d1lMUXAxUk1XS19sZFdudlFkRnRDUEhadFRCSjROZmdJOGh3ay1FZDVqdUVGQ09TQXhLNnZ0bjlUTU9VUTB6RkVBTFgwSEVGMi1tc3E3VHhCY2ZV?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#17</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE9STUVEOXAxQlRvUUpLV253ME5Rbnl0cmp4LVNwd0hvWnpuQm9Sb0c4Z05Hb25nSjh1YzlZOE00c3NnVHRDVUdBZk15Z2JBT1I0YWFlczN0YUFNQlpQY0Jqdg?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#26</a>]. 한미그룹 측은 혁신 성과 창출을 강조하며 정면 대응에 나섰으나, 모녀 측을 겨냥한 공세가 이어지며 경영권 분쟁을 둘러싼 긴장감이 고조되는 형국입니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMia0FVX3lxTFBtVDhFLXNNTmFLbVBQMVh4d1lMUXAxUk1XS19sZFdudlFkRnRDUEhadFRCSjROZmdJOGh3ay1FZDVqdUVGQ09TQXhLNnZ0bjlUTU9VUTB6RkVBTFgwSEVGMi1tc3E3VHhCY2ZV?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#17</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiYEFVX3lxTE9STUVEOXAxQlRvUUpLV253ME5Rbnl0cmp4LVNwd0hvWnpuQm9Sb0c4Z05Hb25nSjh1YzlZOE00c3NnVHRDVUdBZk15Z2JBT1I0YWFlczN0YUFNQlpQY0Jqdg?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#26</a>].\n\n<b>3. 바이오·헬스케어 기업들의 자본 조달 및 상장 추진</b>\n페니트리움바이오는 주주배정 유상증자에서 91.03%의 청약률을 기록하며 실권주 일반공모에 돌입했고, HLB테라퓨틱스는 HLB가 보유한 110억 원 규모의 전환사채를 사실상 출자전환하기로 결정했습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMic0FVX3lxTE5kaG5qVjF3b25uazNPV0M1RUVYUnJKX0JqbHVZU2Q4Vkx0NklaeEpPYkVwcFE0SU9iaTlJMDY2Nlk4QzRldjRJdkkwaE56dGdEelBSLUl3Y3VaZDZMV0pqbHRTRkJ1V0wxNUF5ckwzeTR2dTQ?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#16</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibkFVX3lxTE1tZW9XbnJ2aUlpM2JsNUNfdTIzZ3VRVUpjRENNNlVqT1BBUlFHLU5vQnVFWXRrSUg1TU5LWEJHVjZwYUdtV3NteW5aVE1la1JfSzNLNndWOUpUZGFjNVVNaHFfWTRNS0R4LS0zWXFB?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#28</a>]. 한편 미국 나스닥에 상장한 브레이브하트 바이오는 첫 거래일에 주가가 68% 폭등하며 3억 8,250만 달러 규모의 IPO를 성공적으로 마쳤습니다 [<a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxPcXJJY1JoTGZMV2d3dmNxSjB2TEJwTWNpblgxcFl5ZmJCckViYVE2dHJUNUN3dHBGbXYtX2xDelRoWjJVZDhfVzZXbGNJU25EVlBMcS10UDhIb3JVaDloV3c1SGtYZGt1Ty0zb1l2TXFkV2JqU0VCRkFSa1piV0c5Zk1xMFJQSUFPRDZEV0pwWGlnc1g1dy1FUk9jenJLeUFHVFhUTGQyNjZ6cUtmQnU2RTJfSEw?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#37</a> <a href=\"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigwFBVV95cUxOQ3poSzA2dGM3U2lrNWRGeG43NFRKNFpjSUVDTGhhajFPcHFoR18tdGlMUHgzandMbDZaVzlSWTFCb1ZOczNwLXZ4MjJKMi0yUEE5MmFtUTZpZElFTkFNRG1Iekx6VmVEWnJwd0c1Z1pOcVI1NTRmby0xS05BZW9la2d0OA?oc=5\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">#39</a>].\n\n<b>4.